      "check_id": "UNKNOWN",
      "title": "Unrestricted ingress to plaintext and alternate web ports",
      "resource": "google_compute_firewall.allow_http_https",
      "severity": "HIGH",
      "explanation": "The firewall permits internet-wide access to TCP ports 80 and 8080, exposing plaintext or alternate HTTP services to unauthenticated external traffic. Only the encrypted HTTPS port needs to remain publicly accessible."
    }
  ],
  "patched_code": "resource \"google_compute_firewall\" \"allow_http_https\" {\n  name    = \"digital-asset-trading-platform-firewall-web\"\n  network = google_compute_network.digital_asset_trading_vpc.name\n  allow {\n    protocol = \"tcp\"\n    ports    = [\"443\"]\n  }\n  source_ranges = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]\n  target_tags   = [\"web-server\"]\n}\n",
  "fix_summary": "Removed public ingress on plaintext HTTP port 80 and alternate port 8080. Public access is now limited to encrypted HTTPS traffic on TCP port 443."
}
